===== Deployed-pipeline benchmark (6 seed scenarios via public API) 2026-09-29 =====
Ran benchmark/run_deployed.sh against https://zx9d4nrkni.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
after bumping Lambda to 1024MB and hardening the detector retry (3 attempts, HTTP/URL errors +
malformed JSON, backoff).

benign_001   label=benign exp=LOW  got=LOW  score=0   ev=0  lat=1674ms OK
benign_002   label=benign exp=LOW  got=LOW  score=0   ev=0  lat=1440ms OK
benign_003   label=benign exp=LOW  got=LOW  score=0   ev=0  lat=887ms  OK
scam_001     label=scam   exp=HIGH got=HIGH score=102 ev=5  lat=13487ms OK
scam_002     label=scam   exp=HIGH got=HIGH score=99  ev=6  lat=9100ms  OK
scam_003     label=scam   exp=HIGH got=HIGH score=85  ev=5  lat=8637ms  OK

6 passed, 0 failed.

Note: a first rapid sequential run showed 2 transient scam failures (no risk_level in body);
individual re-calls returned correct HIGH. Root cause was a transient Mantle error/timeout not
absorbed by the original single retry. Fix: detector now retries up to 3x covering HTTPError/
URLError/TimeoutError with backoff, and the urlopen timeout was tightened to 16s so a hung call
fails fast enough to retry inside the 40s Lambda budget. Re-run after the fix: 6/6 clean.
Latency: benign ~1s, scam ~8-13s (gpt-oss generates full reasoning + evidence). Frontend animates
the transcript (~5s) in parallel to mask detector latency.
